# Dependencies for development. Don't edit or override this file.
# Use requirements.in to add integration-specific dependencies instead.
# Compiled into requirements-dev.txt, which only CI and the devimage stage install;
# the prod image installs requirements.txt alone, so nothing here ships to production.
# Shared transitive deps are pinned to whatever requirements.txt resolved them to.
-c requirements.txt
# pytest 7.4.x carries GHSA-6w46-j5rx-g56g (tmpdir handling), but it is test-only and
# never reaches the prod image. Moving to pytest 9 needs pytest-asyncio >=1.3, which
# breaks fixtures that build asyncio.Future() in several integrations, so that upgrade
# ships as its own PR. app/conftest.py's async_return already works on both lines.
pytest~=7.4.3
pytest-asyncio~=0.21.1
pytest-mock~=3.12.0
